{"quest":{"quest_name":"DS-ACAD-C01-005","quest_id":126348,"has_definition":true,"link_kind":"none","title":"The Final Countdown","title_source":"none","inference_basis":null},"text_rows":[{"key":"WizQst1ED8C_00000000","value":"Take your drake to the Great Volcano and make your way to the headmaster's office. If you've any friends you can count on, you will certainly need them. Good luck!","category":"WizQst1ED8C","used_by_this_file":false,"field":null},{"key":"WizQst1ED8C_00000001","value":"Are you ready to face Malistaire? All that's left to do is to go to the landing platform, and ride your Drake up to the entrance of the Great Volcano. If you have any friends you can summon to aid you, you will need them.","category":"WizQst1ED8C","used_by_this_file":true,"field":"m_dialogList.m_dialogs[0].m_dialogEntries[0].m_dialog"},{"key":"WizQst1ED8C_00000002","value":"Once there, you can make your way up to the headmaster's office. Malistaire should be there. He'll see you coming, so you will need to be on guard. ","category":"WizQst1ED8C","used_by_this_file":true,"field":"m_dialogList.m_dialogs[0].m_dialogEntries[1].m_dialog"},{"key":"WizQst1ED8C_00000003","value":"I'm so afraid... I can't believe it, but a chill just ran down my branches!","category":"WizQst1ED8C","used_by_this_file":true,"field":"m_dialogList.m_dialogs[0].m_dialogEntries[2].m_dialog"},{"key":"WizQst1ED8C_00000004","value":"Go and face Malistaire... be the hero you've shown us you are! ","category":"WizQst1ED8C","used_by_this_file":true,"field":"m_dialogList.m_dialogs[0].m_dialogEntries[3].m_dialog"},{"key":"WizQst1ED8C_00000007","value":"Dragonspyre|Malistaire's Lair","category":"WizQst1ED8C","used_by_this_file":true,"field":"m_goals[2].m_locationName"},{"key":"WizQst1ED8C_00000008","value":"Dragonspyre|Dragonspyre Academy","category":"WizQst1ED8C","used_by_this_file":true,"field":"m_goals[0].m_locationName"},{"key":"WizQst1ED8C_00000009","value":"Young Battledrake","category":"WizQst1ED8C","used_by_this_file":false,"field":null},{"key":"WizQst1ED8C_00000010","value":"Malistaire's Lair","category":"WizQst1ED8C","used_by_this_file":false,"field":null},{"key":"WizQst1ED8C_00000012","value":"Bravo, bravo, $PLAYER_FIRSTNAME$! Because you stopped Malistaire, you've saved every world upon the Spiral. ","category":"WizQst1ED8C","used_by_this_file":true,"field":"m_goals[3].m_dialogList.m_dialogs[0].m_dialogEntries[0].m_dialog"},{"key":"WizQst1ED8C_00000013","value":"<ITALICS>The Headmaster looks at you with a twinkle in his eyes. </ITALICS>","category":"WizQst1ED8C","used_by_this_file":true,"field":"m_goals[3].m_dialogList.m_dialogs[0].m_dialogEntries[1].m_dialog"},{"key":"WizQst1ED8C_00000014","value":"I remember when you first enrolled at Ravenwood. I thought I saw something special in you.","category":"WizQst1ED8C","used_by_this_file":true,"field":"m_goals[3].m_dialogList.m_dialogs[0].m_dialogEntries[2].m_dialog"},{"key":"WizQst1ED8C_00000015","value":"I apologize for the actions of my brother, Malistaire. With your help, I have released Sylvia's spirit and have done my best to set things right.","category":"WizQst1ED8C","used_by_this_file":true,"field":"m_goals[3].m_dialogList.m_dialogs[0].m_dialogEntries[3].m_dialog"},{"key":"WizQst1ED8C_00000016","value":"And I admit that I should have trusted your instincts about $PLAYER_FIRSTNAME$, Ambrose. Though off to a rough start, $PLAYER_FIRSTNAME$ has become a truly remarkable student.","category":"WizQst1ED8C","used_by_this_file":true,"field":"m_goals[3].m_dialogList.m_dialogs[0].m_dialogEntries[4].m_dialog"},{"key":"WizQst1ED8C_00000017","value":"Ah, indeed.","category":"WizQst1ED8C","used_by_this_file":true,"field":"m_goals[3].m_dialogList.m_dialogs[0].m_dialogEntries[5].m_dialog"},{"key":"WizQst1ED8C_00000031","value":"Cyrus Drake","category":"WizQst1ED8C","used_by_this_file":true,"field":"m_goals[3].m_dialogList.m_dialogs[0].m_dialogEntries[3].m_nameOverride"}],"goal_gates":[{"goal_name":"Goal","required_status":"Incom